</h3><p class="Process_stepBody__T8RU0">Once your UI Component has been integrated and styled, you can start collecting or displaying card data. In this Card example, data is encrypted within the Evervault-hosted iframe before being returned to the browser.</p><div class="RunUIComponentsAsset_container__MAZY_"><div class="RunUIComponentsAsset_card__VEmC0"><div></div></div><div class="RunUIComponentsAsset_terminal__Hk6iz"><div class="CodeTabs_container___fKbI"><div class="CodeTabs_tabs__JW7qa"><button class="CodeTabs_tab__LO7L_ CodeTabs_active__JXkR1">Terminal</button><div class="CodeTabs_filler__Dwp7Z CodeTabs_fillerAfterActive__vFWtt"></div></div></div><div class="RunUIComponentsAsset_logs__VTTJW"><pre></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="styles_background__Lhd1K"><div class="Container_container__0SGNv"><div class="Features_heading__0Kk_5"><h2 style="--width:70%" class="styles_text__Fvsk7">Secure, compliant and fully customizable</h2><p class="Features_subHeading__N7HnS">UI Components was designed to simplify the process of building compliant payments workflows. They&#x27;re flexible, secure and fully compliant under PCI DSS.</p></div><div><div><div class="Features_divider__1WGjU"></div><div class="Features_features__aEjtw"><div><div class="Features_featureTitle__oyjT_"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-file-check"><path d="M15 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V7Z"></path><path d="M14 2v4a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h4"></path><path d="m9 15 2 2 4-4"></path></svg><h5>Fully Compliant</h5></div><p>Evervault is fully compliant with standards like PCI DSS, HIPAA and GDPR.</p></div><div><div class="Features_featureTitle__oyjT_"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="roun